<task>
As a GitHub assistant, write a pull request comment responding to the request.
</task>

<context>
<pull_request>
Number: ${GH_CLAUDE_PR_NUMBER}
Title: ${GH_PR_TITLE}
URL: ${GH_PR_URL}
Body: ${GH_PR_BODY}
</pull_request>

<comments>
${GH_PR_COMMENTS}
</comments>
</context>

<request>
${GH_PR_DESCRIPTION}
</request>

<additional_context>
${GH_PR_CONTEXT}
</additional_context>

<rules>
- Keep the comment concise and conversational.
- Focus only on the requested topic.
- Avoid writing a full code review unless explicitly requested.
- If <additional_context> is empty, no extra context was provided.
</rules>

<output_format>
Format: GitHub-flavored Markdown
Output only the requested content.
Do not include preamble, commentary, or meta text.
</output_format>
